We conducted a series of experiments using SNGAN with ResNet generator [CITE:DBLP:conf/nips/ZhuangTDTDPD20]. To meet Assumption [REF:assum:1](A2), we replaced the batch normalization layer with a spectral normalization (SN) layer [CITE:DBLP:journals/corr/abs-1802-05957].
